WEBVTT

00:13:27.840 --> 00:13:30.856
Na inaathiri watu wa rangi pia.

00:13:30.880 --> 00:13:35.416
Na inafanya watu wa rangi,
kama watu weupe,

00:13:35.440 --> 00:13:38.680
kuchagua kinyume na mapendeleo yetu.

00:13:45.080 --> 00:13:46.536
Baadhi yenu mnaweza kuuliza --

00:13:46.560 --> 00:13:50.816
na wanafunzi wangu wananiambia
ninatoa kazi ngumu --

00:13:50.840 --> 00:13:53.680
baadhi yenu mnaweza kuuliza, na kwa
usahihi kabisa,

00:13:55.640 --> 00:13:58.376
"Tunawezaje kurekebisha hili?

00:13:58.400 --> 00:14:01.640
Inaonekana ina nguvu sana
na inatutawala."